OpenNARS 3.0.4 TypeScript

This project is a TypeScript rewrite and adaptation of the OpenNARS 3.0.4
Java implementation. The Java source, behavior baseline, and original project
are attributed to The OpenNARS authors and remain available under the MIT
License in LICENSE.

OpenNARS upstream:

- Project: https://www.opennars.org/
- Canonical source lineage: https://github.com/opennars/opennars

The TypeScript source, project-owned runtime contracts, native containers,
Node.js host adapter, browser adapter, tests, documentation, and release
automation in this repository are maintained as the OpenNARS-304-ts project.
This repository is not the original OpenNARS Java distribution.
